<title>USA: Environmental Safeguards names Ronald Bianco CFO.</title>
<headline>Environmental Safeguards names Ronald Bianco CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Environmental Safeguards Inc said Wednesday it had appointed Ronald Bianco as chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>Bianco will replace Michael Dunson, who will become director of business development, a company official said.</p>
<p>Bianco was chief financial officer of SWECO Oilfield Services.</p>
<p>Environmental Safeguards is a recycler and remediator of hydrocarbon and hydrocarbon derivative contaminated soil.</p>
</text>
